{"sha": "838beaec2a8e57fa368d32996a9bf2f020ffc5d281645e8e8a237c205b909d1e", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g2:subtraction} 章 --- 减法}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:1}", "$58 - 23 = 35$; \\quad $176 - 45 = 131$; \\quad $389 - 164 = 225$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:2}", "$52 - 17 = 35$; \\quad $73 - 28 = 45$; \\quad $60 - 24 = 36$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:3}", "$324 - 167 = 157$（验算 $157 + 167 = 324$）； \\quad", "$500 - 236 = 264$（验算 $264 + 236 = 500$）； \\quad", "$703 - 158 = 545$（验算 $545 + 158 = 703$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:4}", "$62 - 58 = 4$; \\quad $91 - 85 = 6$; \\quad $100 - 96 = 4$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:5}", "$50 - 42 = 8$; \\quad $20 - 13 = 7$; \\quad $100 - 75 = 25$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:6}", "去年：$156 - 28 = 128$ 厘米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:7}", "$85 - 39 = 46$：验算 $46 + 39 = 85$ --- 正确。", "$214 - 68 = 156$：验算 $156 + 68 = 224 \\neq 214$ --- 错误（", "正确答案是 $146$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:8}", "“飞走”：$47 - 19 = 28$。“又摘了”：$47 + 19 = 66$。", "“相差多少”：$47 - 19 = 28$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:9}", "从 $45$ 数到 $63$ 是 $18$，所以 $63 - 18 = 45$：空缺处的数是 $18$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g2:subtraction:10}", "从 $58$ 倒推：减 $18$ 之前，这个数是", "$58 + 18 = 76$；加 $30$ 之前，这个数是 $76 - 30 = 46$。", "开始的数是 $46$（验算：$46 + 30 - 18 = 58$）。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}